{"id":"act-2","label":"Act 2","blocks":[{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 1"},{"k":"d","text":"A Scene, as in Act 1. Elvira’s House at the side, with practicable Window and Door."},{"k":"d","text":"Don Juan; Leporello."},{"k":"d","text":"Duet."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Away, you buffoon, and","Torment me no more."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I’ll quit you now, sir,","For thus I swore."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hear me, I pray you."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I’ll go; but what say you?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What have I done, now,","That you will leave me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Of course nothing!","Only half-kill’d me;","And I’m not joking,","For now I will go."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What are you thinking?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["No; I will go."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Leporello!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Signor?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["No more of this story.","Come here, and take this."]},{"k":"d","text":"Gives him a purse."},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["How much?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Four guineas."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["That’s not amiss!","For this once I permit—","And to it must submit;","But pray don’t repeat it:","’Tis really not fit","To bribe thus my honor with money."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, speak of that no more. Have you courage","To do what I shall tell you?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, if you’ll leave the women."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["I leave the women! Fool!","That shall I never do! Know that to me","They’re more delightful than the bread I eat—","Yes, or the air I breathe."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["And have you, then, the heart","Thus to deceive them all?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["It is my love!","He who is true to only one,","Is harsh to all but her alone.","This lib’ral view I still maintain,","And I wish well to all I can.","The ladies call my good intention","Without considering, a deception."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Never have I seen, then,","Benevolence more vast, nor more extensive!","Now, what is it you want?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, listen! Have you seen the lady’s maid","Of Donna Elvira?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["No."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Then have you never","Seen person so charming!","Hear, my friend Leporello: when with her","To try my fortune hard I’ve been thinking,","Now that evening’s drawing on","The more to heighten her enjoyment,","To show myself in this your vestment."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["And why could you not","Appear in yours?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["The dress of a noble","With people like her,","Would too fine appear.","Be quick!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["My lord, hear me, I pray—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Be silent, for I’ll have my way."]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 2"},{"k":"d","text":"Donna Elvira. The same."},{"k":"d","text":"Trio."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"d","text":"at the window"},{"k":"v","lines":["Be silent, trembling heart!","Beat not, my breast within","He’s impious, a deceiver;","To pity him is sin."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hush! of Lady Elvira,","My lord, the voice I hear."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, let me seize the moment!","Remain an instant here.","Elvira, my ador’d one!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is that not the deceiver?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, yes, indeed, ’tis I, love,","Who once to thee was dear."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Heav’ns! what a strange confusion","Now agitates my heart!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Again see her delusion!","For she believes him still."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Descend, oh beauteous lady!","And you again shall feel","How much my heart adores you,","And now repents its ill!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, cruel man! can I believe thee?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Slay me, my love, if I deceive thee!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["My laughter I must smother!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["My love, oh pray come hither!"]},{"k":"d","text":"A 3."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Cruel one! can I believe thee?","Much too credulous am I!","Ye pitying Powers, protect me!","Now, shall I go or stay?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["It was well worth the trial—","There’s none so much can say;","And I’ve a wond’rous talent","For leading them astray!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, what a smooth deceiver!","A second time he’ll leave her:","Protect her, gracious Heav’n!","And pity her, I pray!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["My friend, what think you of it."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["A heart you have, I think","As hard as any bronze."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, what a simpleton are you! Now hear me:","When she comes hither,","Run and embrace her—","Caress her most tenderly—","Contrive to feign my voice; and then, with art","Seek to conduct her away with thee."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["But, sir—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["No reply!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["If she should know me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["She will not find you out, if you are prudent.","Peace! the door opens—now, take care!"]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 3"},{"k":"d","text":"The same."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Behold, I am here!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Let us see what he’ll do."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Here’s a position!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Then could I e’er believe that my complaints","Would melt a heart like thine! and that, repentant,","Don Juan, my belov’d, would to his faith,","And to my love, return!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, yes, belov’d!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, cruel! if you knew","How many sighs, and, ah! how many","A tear of sorrow, you’ve cost me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I, my lov’d life!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, you."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Poor lady, ah, how much I grieve!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Will you ne’er leave me more?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, angel dear!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Will you be always mine?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Always!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["My dearest!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Most lov’d!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Aside."},{"k":"v","lines":["The joke’s delightful!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["My life’s treasure!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Goddess of love!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Love’s soft flame, alas! consumes me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["My heart is scorch’d!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["The rogue grows warm."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["And you will not deceive me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, certainly."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Swear it."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["By this fair hand I swear,","That thus I kiss with joy, and by those eyes!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, ha, there! wretch, you shall die!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, Heav’ns!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Elvira and Leporello run off."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, ha, there, run! Fortune, it seems,","Would now befriend me. Let me see:","These are the windows: now, the serenade."]},{"k":"v","lines":["Come shining forth, my dearest,","With looks of warm delight;","Shed joy as thou appearest,","Like morning beams of light.","Like morning beams of light, love","Mild shines thy azure eye;","Thine absence chilling night, love,","In which I droop and die.","O! let me hear that tongue, love,","Whose music thrills my heart.","Like notes by angels sung, love,","When souls in bliss depart;","And to thy casement sing,","Illume my ravish’d sight,","Like day the world surprising","With morning’s beam of light."]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 4"},{"k":"d","text":"Don Juan; Masetto, followed by a crowd of armed Peasants."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["There’s some one at the window:","Perhaps ’tis she. Hist! hist!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Let us not hesitate;—my heart now tells me","That we ought to find him here."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Some one speaks."]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Halt there a moment—listen:","I think that some one moves."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["If I mistake not, ’tis Masetto."]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who goes there? Does no one answer?","Level your guns, my friends—be bold:","Who goes there?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["He’s not alone;","I must be cautious."]},{"k":"d","text":"Aloud."},{"k":"v","lines":["Hear, my friends,"]},{"k":"d","text":"Aside."},{"k":"v","lines":["I wish not to betray myself. Masetto!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis so; and you?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Do you not know me? The servant","Am I of fam’d Don Juan—"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Leporello!","Servant of that unworthy cavalier?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Certainly, of that knave."]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Of that man lost to honor, come, tell me now,","Where we may quickly find him:","I and my friends are seeking, and would kill him."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["A fine joke this!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Aloud."},{"k":"v","lines":["My brave Masetto.","I also will go with you","To help you catch this villain of a master;","But hear a moment what is my intention:","Place half your numbers here, the others there—","Then he will not escape. If you should hear","Some person courting underneath the balcony,","Or should you chance to notice in the square","A lady walking with a well-dress’d youth,","Strike hard, for that is he; do not delay—","Now, quickly, all begone.","Remain alone with me,","And shortly I’ll explain the reason why."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exeunt Peasants."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 5"},{"k":"d","text":"Don Juan; Masetto."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hush! let me listen. Excellent!","Then we must kill him?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Of course."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["But would it not suffice to break his bones,","And beat him black and blue?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, no, sir! I will kill him!","I’ll tear him all to pieces."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Have you good weapons?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Have I not?","See, first I have this musket;"]},{"k":"d","text":"Giving it to Juan."},{"k":"v","lines":["And next, see here, this pistol."]},{"k":"d","text":"Giving it."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["And next?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is’t not enough?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Enough, of course. Now, take","This for your precious pistol,"]},{"k":"d","text":"Beating him."},{"k":"v","lines":["And this for your good musket."]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Alas! alas! Oh, my poor head—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Hush, or I’ll kill thee."]},{"k":"d","text":"Beating him again."},{"k":"v","lines":["This is for going to kill him,","This is for tearing him up;—","You villain, you ruffian, you ugly-fac’d cur!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 6"},{"k":"d","text":"Masetto; afterwards Zerlina."},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"d","text":"crying loudly"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, alas! Oh, my poor head.","Oh, oh, my shoulders! Oh, my back!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["I thought just now I heard","The voice of my Masetto."]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, Heav’ns! Zerlina!","Zerlina, come and help me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["What has happen’d?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["The wretch, the wicked villain","Has broken all my bones."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, dear me! who?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Leporello,","Or else some devil that resembles him."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["How cruel! but I told you,","That by your foolish senseless jealousy,","You’d bring yourself into some dreadful harm.","Where are you hurt?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Here."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Where else?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Here; and here, also."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Are you hurt nowhere else?"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, yes, a little","Here in this foot, this arm, and in this hand."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Well, well, you’re not much hurt, if that is all.","Come with me to the house.","Only now make a promise","Henceforth to be less jealous.","And I will heal thee soon, my own dear husband."]},{"k":"v","lines":["List, and I’ll find, love,","If you are kind, love,","Balm for your mind, love,","Patient but be.","This balm so pure, love,","Simple and sure, love,","Sweet to endure, love,","None knew but me.","Thrilling and healing,","Over thee stealing,","Exquisite feeling,","Meant but for thee!","To thy entreating","I’ll yield it, dear!","Feel how ’tis beating!","Beating just here!"]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 7"},{"k":"d","text":"An inner Court in the House of Elvira."},{"k":"d","text":"Leporello; Donna Elvira."},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["The light of many torches","Approaches, my beloved: let’s stop a moment","And give them time to pass."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["But what fear you,","My husband, my ador’d one?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Nothing, nothing;","Only I thought—I’ll see now if the light","Is gone yet."]},{"k":"d","text":"Aside."},{"k":"v","lines":["But how can I","Make my escape from her?"]},{"k":"d","text":"Aloud."},{"k":"v","lines":["Wait here a moment, love."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, leave me not!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Sestette."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Here, alone, in this drear darkness,","How my heart with fear doth tremble.","My alarm I can’t dissemble—","I feel as if e’en death were nigh."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["The more I search I still am further","From this most infernal door.","Softly, softly—now I’ve found it,","And this is the time to fly."]},{"k":"d","text":"He conceals himself."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 8"},{"k":"d","text":"Don Octavio; Donna Anna. The same."},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Dry those tears, they wring my heart, love!","Could I comfort now impart, love!","Even the shade of thy brave father","Will mourn at every deep-felt sigh."]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yet amidst my desolation,","Still remains the consolation,","Death, my love, will end my suffering—","Would that now I here could die!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, where art thou, dearest husband?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["I am lost, if here they find me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA AND LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Here’s a door;—now softly open it,","To escape them let us try."]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 9"},{"k":"d","text":"Zerlina, Masetto, with lights. The same."},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO AND ZERLINA"},{"k":"d","text":"seeing Leporello"},{"k":"v","lines":["Villain, stop! you pass not here."]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA AND OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["See the wretch! How came he there?"]},{"k":"d","text":"A 4."},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA, OCTAVIO, ZERLINA AND MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Death to the traitor","That has betray’d thee!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, ’tis my husband!","Pity, I pray ye!"]},{"k":"d","text":"A 4."},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA, OCTAVIO, ZERLINA AND MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is it Elvira","Whom I descry?","Can I believe it?","No; let him die!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Pardon, dear gentlemen!","She does mistake;","And she imagines","I am that rake.","Oh, pray don’t kill me,","For mercy’s sake!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA, OCTAVIO, ZERLINA AND MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis Leporello!","See, some new treachery!","Yet that ’tis he","I cannot deny."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Like the roaring foaming ocean,","My brain is in a wild commotion;","If I escape in such a tempest,","’Tis a miracle indeed!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA, OCTAVIO, ZERLINA AND MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Like the roaring foaming ocean,","Is my heart in wild commotion;","But just vengeance shall o’ertake him—","He shall perish, ’tis decreed!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exeunt Donna Anna and Leporello."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Stay, traitor, stay!"]},{"k":"s","text":"MASETTO"},{"k":"v","lines":["The rogue has wings to his feet."]},{"k":"s","text":"ZERLINA"},{"k":"v","lines":["How artfully","The wretch has slunk away!"]},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["My friends,","After offences so enormous,","We can no longer doubt that this Don Juan","Was the impious murderer","Of Donna Anna’s father. In this house,","For a few hours, remain: I’ll have recourse","To those whose duty ’tis; and very soon","I promise to avenge you:","For honor, justice, love my efforts claim."]},{"k":"v","lines":["Fly, then, my love, entreating,","To calm, to calm her anxious fears;","Oh, still her heart’s wild beating,","And wipe away her tears.","Tell her I’ll vengeance take","On him who slew her sire;","This arm his grave shall make,","Or I’ll by his expire."]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 10"},{"k":"d","text":"A walled Cemetery, in the midst of which the Statue of the Commandant is seen."},{"k":"d","text":"Don Juan, who leaps over the wall; afterwards Leporello."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! ah! ah! this is good!","Now let them seek me. What a lovely night!","’Tis clearer than the day; and seems to court me","To rove about, and hunt for pretty girls.","Is it yet late? Oh no!","’Tis not two hours past midnight. I much wish","To know how that affair at length was finish’d","Between Leporello and fair Donna Elvira;","And if he play’d his part discreetly."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"Out of breath behind the wall"},{"k":"v","lines":["Surely, he wishes to be death to me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis he! Oh, Leporello!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who calls me there?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Do you not know your master?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Would I had never known him!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["How? you rogue!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, is it you! Excuse me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What’s the matter?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["On your account, I’ve just been almost murder’d."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Well, and was not that","An honor?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Sir, thank you!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Come, come, this way:","I’ve some rare tales to tell you!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["But what do you do here?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Just jump o’er, and you shall know.","Some pleasant little affairs,","That have befallen me since you went away,","I’ll tell you another time; the best of all","I’m going to tell you now."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Of the fair ones, I’m certain."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["You’re right! A charming creature,","Beautiful, young, and gay,","I met in the street; and, accosting her,","I took her by the hand—she tried to avoid me:","But after a few words she took me for—","Whom think you?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I know not."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["For Leporello!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["For me!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["For thee!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Very fine!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["By the hand","She then, in turn, took me."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Still better!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["She smother’d me with caresses—","‘Oh, my dearest Leporello!","Leporello, my dear!’ Then it struck me","She was some beauty of your’s."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, cursed chance!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["I profited by her mistake: unluckily,","She soon discover’d me, and cried aloud,—","People approach’d and then ’twas time to run","And, quick as light, I jump’d here o’er the wall."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["And all this you tell me","As lightly and carelessly—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["And why not?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Suppose that pretty girl should be my wife?"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"laughing loudly"},{"k":"v","lines":["Then, better still!"]},{"k":"d","text":"The Statue speaks."},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Thy mirth shall have an end","Before the morning dawns!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Who spoke there?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! some spirit","Spoke from the other world,","Who knows your inmost soul."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Silence, thou fool! Who goes there?"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Audacious ribald, cease!","Let the dead sleep in peace."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Even so I told you."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Some one must be outside,","Who scoffs at us."]},{"k":"d","text":"With indifference and contempt"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ha! is not this the statue","Of the Commandant? Step forward","And read the inscription."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Excuse me:","I never learn’d to read","In light so pale."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Read, I say!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"reads"},{"k":"v","lines":["‘On him who slew me, Heaven’s Revenge I here","Am now awaiting!’"]},{"k":"v","lines":["List! I shake with fear!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, venerable fool of fools!","Tell him that this evening","With me I hope he’ll sup."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["What madness!","See, see! Oh, Heavens! behold","What an awful glance he cast","Upon us then! He is alive—he hears—","And is about to speak!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["At once go—speak,","Or else you die! Go quickly—speak I say!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Then softly, softly, master—I’ll obey."]},{"k":"d","text":"Duet."},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, thou most gracious statue","Of the once great Commandant—","My lord, my courage fails me;","I can proceed no further."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Go on, or you shall feel","The sharpness of this steel."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["How horrid! his caprice how bold!","Now I feel my blood run cold!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["What a jest! oh, what delight!","Greatly I enjoy his fright."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, thou most courteous statue,","Though thou of marble be—","Ah, look, my lord! oh, see!","He turns his eyes on me."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Perish, villain!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Stay, I entreat you!"]},{"k":"d","text":"To the Statue."},{"k":"v","lines":["My lord, my noble master—","My master, and not I—","Ah! ah! with fear I die!","Oh, Heav’n! he bows his head!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Away, or else this sword—"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, look again, my lord!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["And what should I behold?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["My lord, the marble cold,","Even thus, inclines its head."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Speak, if you are able:","To supper will you come?"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["He has frighten’d me to death!","Scarce can I draw my breath!","I really can’t stay here:","For mercy’s sake, begone!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["It ceases to be pleasant—","At supper he’ll be present;","Then let us quick prepare,","And hence we will begone."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exeunt."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 12"},{"k":"d","text":"A Room."},{"k":"d","text":"Donna Anna; Don Octavio."},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Be calm, my love, for soon this libertine","Shall punishment receive for his excesses,","And we shall be aveng’d."]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA"},{"k":"v","lines":["But yet, my father’s death!"]},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Still we must bow our heads","Before the will of the celestial powers.","For what you’ve lost, take comfort;","And, my belov’d, to-morrow, if you please","Receive this hand and heart,","With my most tender love!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, me! what say you,","In moments of such sadness?"]},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["And why will you,","With still-renew’d delays","Increase my anxious cares!","’Tis cruel!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ANNA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Cruel! ah, no!","My love, too much I grieve","Thus to delay a hope that long ago","Our hearts desir’d; and yet, what will the world say?","Do not shake the constancy","Of my heart, so deeply griev’d,","But yet love pleads for thee too earnestly."]},{"k":"d","text":"Air."},{"k":"v","lines":["Say not then, dear love, of me,","That I’m cruel unto thee;","Since you know my constancy,","And how faithfully I love."]},{"k":"v","lines":["Calm, ah! calm that anxious heart!","Unless with grief you’d see me die.","A day will come, no more to part,","And Heav’n to us its grace will prove."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"s","text":"OCTAVIO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! her footsteps let me follow;","I’ll share her griefs, and mingle sighs with hers:","Her sorrow will be less, when shar’d with mine."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 13"},{"k":"d","text":"A large Hall, illuminated, with a Table laid out."},{"k":"d","text":"Don Juan, Leporello."},{"k":"d","text":"Finale."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["All’s prepar’d, the banquet’s ready—","Gaily let the music sound;","Here with mirth and joy abounding","Will we pass the night away.","Leporello, wait at table."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Sir, your orders I obey."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Is that melody not charming?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, when wine the heart is warming."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["And what delicious viands these!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Bless me! how he does enjoy it!","My poor mouth I could employ it,","Very gladly, if he’d please."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! the hungry rascal’s dying","Now to join in this good cheer,","Plates, here!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, sir.","Ah, I know that tune well!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Bring me wine."]},{"k":"d","text":"Drinks."},{"k":"v","lines":["Excellent! the flavor’s fine!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["Pheasant’s wing! just the thing!","It shall quickly disappear."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, the rascal! how he’s stuffing!","But I will not interfere."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"again listening to the music"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, I know that also, well!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Leporello!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, good master!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Plainly speak, you knave and tell—"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, I’ve got a shocking cold, sir;","And my throat is not quite clear."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["You can whistle while I’m eating."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I don’t know how."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What’s that you say?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Pardon me!","But your cook’s so very clever,","That I’m making an endeavor—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Yes, my cook’s so very clever,","You’ll eat up everything that’s here."]},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 14"},{"k":"d","text":"Donna Elvira. The same."},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"d","text":"to Don Juan"},{"k":"v","lines":["The last proof","Of my affection","Still I wish","To give to thee:"]},{"k":"d","text":"She kneels."},{"k":"v","lines":["For no longer","Thy deception","Yet e’en pity—"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN AND LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["What’s this to me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["This injur’d heart","No more from thee","Will claim thy faith,","Thou now art free."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What is’t you ask?","I am surpris’d.","I can’t permit—","Fair lady, rise."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, deride not","My misfortunes!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["I deride thee!","Heav’ns! for why?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Her sorrow almost","Makes me cry!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What would you, fair lady?"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah, change your life!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Very good!"]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, faithless heart!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Let me be quiet;","Or, if you’ll join me,","Sit here by me."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"v","lines":["Remain, then, barbarian,","In crime and despair—","A dreadful example","Of evil and care."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"d","text":"aside"},{"k":"v","lines":["If by her sorrow","She cannot move him,","His heart is of stone—","But heart he has none."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Long live the women!","Here’s to good wine!","Delight and support","Of all mankind."]},{"k":"s","text":"ELVIRA"},{"k":"d","text":"going"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What cry is that, Leporello?","Go see what has happen’d."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit Leporello, and returns affrighted"},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["What means that dreadful cry?","Leporello, what is it?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Oh, my lord, for mercy’s sake,","Not a step now farther go!","The man of stone, the man in white—","Ah, my lord, I’m fainting quite!","If you’d seen his dreadful figure,—","If you’d heard his footstep sound—","Ta, ta, ta, ta!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["This I do not understand."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ta, ta, ta, ta!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Certainly you are gone mad."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Listen! ah!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["’Tis some one knocking:","Open!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I tremble!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Open, I say!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! ah!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Open!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah! ah!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Madman!","So, this prodigy to witness,","I must myself unclose the door."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["I do not wish to see him more,","And I’ll hide myself at once."]},{"k":"d","text":"Hides himself under the Table."},{"k":"h","level":3,"text":"Scene 15"},{"k":"d","text":"The Commandant. The same."},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Don Juan, here, at your request,","See, I am come—behold thy guest!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Never could I have believ’d it.","But I’ll do the best I can.","Leporello, another supper","Order them at once to bring."]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Ah my lord, I freeze with horror!"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Pause an instant!","We partake not earthly banquets","Who with Heav’nly food are fed:","By other motives hither led—","Other cares have brought me here!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["My limbs are trembling as with ague,","And from head to foot I shake!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Speak—what would you? I attend."]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["While I speak, listen! my minutes are few!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Speak, speak! I’m all attention."]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Thou didst invite me hither,","And now I invite thee!","Reply: oh, wilt thou come","To be a guest with me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Alas! alas! we have no time—excuse me."]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["The stain of coward fear","Shall never spot my name."]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Decide then!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Already I’ve resolv’d"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Thou wilt come?"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Say no!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Doubt dwells not in my bosom;","No fear have I: I’ll come!"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Give me thy hand, in proof!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["Take it;—what sudden chill,","That freezes thus my heart!"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Repent, and change thy life,","Or thy last hour is come!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, no—I’ll not repent;","Far hence! away! begone!"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Lost man! once more, repent!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["No, obstinate old man!"]},{"k":"s","text":"COMMANDANT"},{"k":"v","lines":["Henceforth ’twill be too late!"]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"d","text":"seized with despair"},{"k":"v","lines":["Through ev’ry nerve I tremble,—","An icy chill o’erpowers me!","What mean these dreadful gulfs","That open to devour me?"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Horror more dire awaits thee,","And dread is thy dark doom!"]},{"k":"s","text":"JUAN"},{"k":"v","lines":["My heart bursts in my bosom,","The serpents gnaw my vitals!","What tortures! oh, what madness!","What horror! what despair!"]},{"k":"s","text":"LEPORELLO"},{"k":"v","lines":["Alas! what looks of terror!","What agonizing gestures!","What cries, what lamentations!","They pierce my heart with woe!"]},{"k":"s","text":"CHORUS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Horror more dire awaits thee,","And dread is thy dark doom!"]}]}